  "vendor_colour_policy": "Vendor brand colours sit outside the encoding contract: they identify a source, they do not encode a stage or a state. The six signal-source tokens are declared --b-* values carrying whichever of white or ink clears 4.5:1. The three AI marks are the vendors' own artwork, inlined unmodified, so their colours are theirs and are deliberately not tokenised or contrast-adjusted: recolouring a trademark to satisfy a palette rule is not an option. They carry no text, so no text pair applies; the readable element in each pill is the ink product name on white.",
